# {{projectName}}

Scaffolded with [`dude`](https://github.com/cubocicloide/dude) using the
`react-fastapi` stack.

## Layout

```
{{projectName}}/
├── frontend/        # React + Vite + TypeScript
├── backend/         # FastAPI (Python 3.13)
└── docker-compose.yml
```

## Quick start — Docker (recommended)

```bash
# First run (build images + start)
dude up --build

# Subsequent runs
dude up
```

| Service    | URL                                   |
|------------|---------------------------------------|
| Frontend   | http://localhost                      |
| API        | http://localhost:8000                 |
| Health     | http://localhost:8000/api/health      |

### Common commands

| Command                    | Description                                      |
|----------------------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| `dude up --build`          | Rebuild images and start all services            |
| `dude up`                  | Start all services (detached)                    |
| `dude down`                | Stop and remove containers                       |
| `dude logs [service]`      | Follow logs (omit service to follow all)         |
| `dude shell <service>`     | Open a shell inside a running container          |
| `dude api sync`            | Fetch OpenAPI spec → generate typed client       |
| `dude api review`          | Validate the generated client against the spec   |
| `dude lint`                | Run all stack lint checks                        |

## Quick start — local (no Docker)

```bash
# Frontend (terminal 1)
cd frontend
pnpm install
pnpm dev          # http://localhost:5173

# Backend (terminal 2)
cd backend
uv sync
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload   # http://localhost:8000
```
